        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join three tanuki brothers on a bright and strategic adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious force known as the “Void” is slowly corrupting the land, turning once-friendly yokai into fierce enemies. Team up with the tanuki brothers to stop the Void and uncover its true nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro JRPG-style combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hand-drawn yokai and face perilous retro-style turn-based battles. Use elemental affinities and status effects to gain the upper hand in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock a wide variety of unique yokai to aid you on your journey. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple classes, master powerful skills, and face off against challenging bosses across different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each run is different!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With roguelike elements ensuring each run is a new experience - can you reach the final boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/556809968888126bb529307676d8dd36.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join three tanuki brothers on a bright and strategic adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious force known as the “Void” is slowly corrupting the land, turning once-friendly yokai into fierce enemies. Team up with the tanuki brothers to stop the Void and uncover its true nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/6c1734c90b266ef9893cfe5c2986c891.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro JRPG-style combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter hand-drawn yokai and face perilous retro-style turn-based battles. Use elemental affinities and status effects to gain the upper hand in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/7fb17ddf62c9a064be87eb4d0e85edf3.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock a wide variety of unique yokai to aid you on your journey. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple classes, master powerful skills, and face off against challenging bosses across different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/2db7dd79f4a9b907fe97381af7070dac.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each run is different!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With roguelike elements ensuring each run is a new experience - can you reach the final boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.poster.avif?t=1765786093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.webm?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417780/extras/96d2951f599bc6fdff247be18b842e65.mp4?t=1765786093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
